  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 400°F (200°C).",
    "Roll out the tart crust dough and place it in a 9-inch tart pan.",
    "In a skillet, sauté the sliced zucchini, onion, and mushrooms in butter until tender.",
    "Add garlic and sauté for 1 minute.",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "In a separate bowl, beat the egg and mix with a fork.",
    "Add the cooked zucchini mixture to the bowl and mix well.",
    "Pour the egg mixture into the tart crust.",
    "Bake for 25-30 minutes or until the tart is golden brown.",
    "Let it cool for 5 minutes before serving."
